# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Generated/exported artifacts -- not source, per an explicit "without
# json, pdf, png files" request (device configs, exported Assumptions/
# Operating-Point/Summary PDFs, exported Summary PNGs, ad-hoc analysis
# plots). The 2 logo PNGs are real app ASSETS, not generated output --
# nbr-logo-icon.png is read by app.py itself at import time (the favicon/
# spinner source), so excluding it would break `panel serve app.py`
# outright; nbr-logo.png is kept as that icon's own uncropped source image.
*.json
*.pdf
*.png
!nbr-logo.png
!nbr-logo-icon.png
